# Release output
/dist/

# The console's build output and its dependencies. The source and the lockfile
# are the record; 235 kB of hashed bundle regenerated on every build is not.
# No trailing slash on node_modules: a linked worktree can hold a generated
# directory whose external packages point at the primary checkout. The
# directory itself must stay local so workspace packages resolve this branch.
# A whole-tree link was once committed with the machine's absolute path.
node_modules
web/*/dist/
.serena/
